1
00:00:00,743 --> 00:00:02,568
As Uke comes to grab your shoulder

2
00:00:03,169 --> 00:00:07,119
draw back with the opposite hand in front
of his face to control the space

3
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,808
cut down his arm controlling his wrist,

4
00:00:09,809 --> 00:00:10,799
as you do so

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,861
switch your body drawing his arm
towards your shoulder,

6
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:16,889
draw him in and cut down
controlling his wrist

7
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:19,491
continue to turn your body round to his rear

8
00:00:19,992 --> 00:00:21,731
as you do so pin the arm

9
00:00:21,732 --> 00:00:26,112
come round to the front placing
his shoulder in between your knees,

10
00:00:26,113 --> 00:00:28,310
control his wrist with your arm

11
00:00:28,311 --> 00:00:30,894
turning your body towards his head for the pin.

